    "detailed_description": "<h1>ALSO RECOMMENDED FOR YOU</h1><p></p><br><h1>ALSO RECOMMENDED FOR YOU</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>In this game i created a new and fun way to play chess.<br> The game uses the original board, however, it contains only the black pieces<br>and some blocks that can serve to facilitate or hinder the game.<br> All white pieces are behind the board waiting for the king.<br> The king stands alone in front of the board where he must choose his first move,<br>and from there, the player must cross the entire board without being killed by the black pieces.<br><br>The Game was released with 25 /50 stages and now already has 50/50, all levels are working correctly.<br><br>this number may increase depending on the acceptance of the game.<br><br>The controls are simple and easy, basically the player control the king pressing the keyboard arrows or WASD, the player also change the cam pressing C on keyboard, after complete the challenge the game will change level automatically.",
    "about_the_game": "In this game i created a new and fun way to play chess.<br />\r\n The game uses the original board, however, it contains only the black pieces<br />\r\nand some blocks that can serve to facilitate or hinder the game.<br />\r\n All white pieces are behind the board waiting for the king.<br />\r\n The king stands alone in front of the board where he must choose his first move,<br />\r\nand from there, the player must cross the entire board without being killed by the black pieces.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Game was released with 25 /50 stages and now already has 50/50, all levels are working correctly.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nthis number may increase depending on the acceptance of the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe controls are simple and easy, basically the player control the king pressing the keyboard arrows or WASD, the player also change the cam pressing C on keyboard, after complete the challenge the game will change level automatically.",
    "short_description": "Play chess in a way you've never played. Face a board like a labyrinth and try to cross it with the king to join his army.",
